Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: denali: own sensor runtime camera domain

Claim the existing shared TITAN_TOP domain for IMX681 through genpd so its
MCLK runtime transition does not depend on a CAMSS consumer
remaining bound.
Keep the clock configuration and sensor sequencing unchanged.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-denali-front-camera.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1e80100-denali-front-camera.dtsi
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@
 		reg = <0x10>;
 		clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK4_CLK>;
 		clock-names = "xclk";
+		power-domains = <&camcc CAM_CC_TITAN_TOP_GDSC>;
 		assigned-clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK4_CLK>;
 		assigned-clock-rates = <19200000>;
 		reset-gpios = <&tlmm 237 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
